# Photo originals stay out; the generated derivatives under
# public/images/photos and the manifest at src/data/photos.json are committed.
# The hand-written inputs — which photo is the hero, and the alt-text
# overrides — are committed too, so the choices survive a clone and the
# manifest regenerates identically wherever the originals are present.
# (Without them, `npm run photos` writes an empty manifest.)
# Git won't descend into an excluded directory, so the place folders have to
# be re-included before the captions.json inside them can be.
photos/*
!photos/.gitkeep
!photos/hero.json
!photos/*/
photos/*/*
!photos/*/captions.json
